window.products.push({"id":1028087,"name":"US Pride Furniture Classical Style Soft Round Arm 72’’ Wide Golden Yellow Velvet Tufted Twin Size Convertible Sofa Bed with Solid Wooden Legs & High D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813CC+ectpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This sofa is a mix between mid-century and a refined retro style with its classic lines, tufted design with wood legs. The symmetrical design and tapered legs give it a vintage spin, while the soft velvet fabric will offer a cozy feel for everyday use. The sofa easily pulls-out to become a bed, providing sleeping space for guests and sleepovers. It is convertible design lets you transform this sofa into a bed to accommodate overnight guests. The mid-century look that made straight lines and low profiles so popular.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813CC+ectpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"US Pride Furniture","source_asin":"B09FYLTWSS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1028087","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FYLTWSS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FYLTWSS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1028088,"name":"Electric Can Opener, Mini Restaurant Can Opener, Smooth Edge Automatic Electric Can Opener! Chef's Best Choice","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616tM1NTTuL._AC_SL1233_.jpg","description":"1: Recessed blade This automatic can opener features a sharp blade that is safely recessed within the unit. This safety feature helps prevent accidental cuts to your fingers when searching for the tool in your kitchen drawers. 2: Metal gear Using a can opener couldn’t be simpler with the straightforward design of the BangRui Automatic Can Opener. To open a can, position the rim of the can in between the blade and the metal gear. The metal gear guides the rim of the can through the can opener so it moves in a full 360° circle by itself. 3: Battery compartment The new Bangrui can opener is completely different from the original design in appearance. Moreover, it is designed with a plastic sheet in the battery cartridge, which further stabilizes the batteries installed. 4: On/off switch The simple one-touch button couldn’t be easier to operate. Simply press down to begin cutting the can, then press again at any time to stop the action. 5: Magnet When you lift the can opener off the can, the magnet on the BangRui Automatic Can Opener will also pick up the lid. There’s no need to fish into the can with your fingers! It is more hygienic and safe than traditional can openers because the strong magnet does all the work. 6: Insert 2AA batteries in the right poles The battery groove is marked with signs of positive and negative electrodes respectively. While installing the four dry batteries, users should do as indicated by the signs. Once installation is done, cover the battery and the product is ready for use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616tM1NTTuL._AC_SL1233_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"instecho","source_asin":"B07HCB4MNK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1028088","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HCB4MNK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HCB4MNK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1028089,"name":"Nordic Ware Pumpkin Patch Loaf Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h3UlSKkgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Help celebrate the season with festive quick breads and teacakes. This non-stick pan from Nordic Ware is designed to bake evenly and is easy to clean up. The pumpkin patch loaf pan is made of original aluminum bakeware that provides finer details and superior baking performance. The heat reflective exteriors allows for uniform browning so as to enhance the unique cake designs. The nonstick interior ensures easy release and cleanup. Proudly made in the USA by Nordic Ware.Proudly made in the USA by Nordic Ware.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h3UlSKkgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nordic Ware","source_asin":"B003VYVN80","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1028089","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003VYVN80","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003VYVN80","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
