window.products.push({"id":1028170,"name":"4-Way CO2 Air Distributor/Manifold with Integrated Check Valves and MFL Fittings | Perfect for Homebrew Draft Systems & Commercial Kegerators | Includ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ykbx49PkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect for Homebrew Draft Systems & Commercial Kegerators! *Each 4-Way CO2 Air Distributor/Manifold comes with integrated check valves, independent shut-offs, and MFL fittings. We also conveniently include four 5/16” barbs/stems and four swivel nuts, which are standard for gas lines in the beer industry. The four curved white washers are included to ensure there is no metal-to-metal contact, which aids in preventing air loss. As your drafts system grows, this manifold system can grow along with it, by simply removing the 1/4\" brass plug.  *The independent shut-offs not only allow you to choose which keg(s) to provide gas to, they also give you the ability to fix, clean, or swap out kegs without depressurizing your entire kegging system.  *Each beer line also has a check valve that stops the beer from flowing backward. This eliminates the chance of beer accidentally flowing from one keg to another. Check valves also keep beer from backing up into your CO2 Regulator, as well as from contaminating your gas lines.  *We use premium Teflon tape, along with NSF-approved TRU-BLU thread sealant (Not Included). This guarantees a superior seal, while still allowing you to remove or reinstall your check valves for any reason. Most competitors use superglue, which doesn’t allow you to disassemble parts for cleaning, repairs, or changes.  *With your purchase comes a 5-year warranty on parts and labor. We will repair or replace this product for the first 5-years, and in most cases will extend the warranty if need be. We pride ourselves on offering high-quality products that are made to last. Each manifold is assembled in our Texas warehouse, and our team also takes care of any repairs or replacements. Customer service is our #1 priority. Therefore, please contact us with any questions or issues.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ykbx49PkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kegconnection, LLC","source_asin":"B078Y2MVMY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1028170","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078Y2MVMY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078Y2MVMY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
