window.products.push({"id":1028460,"name":"Cooling Blanket for Hot Sleepers, Cooling Blanket Twin, Lightweight Summer Blanket Absorbs Heat to Keep Adults/Children/Babies Cool on Warm Nights (59","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eJKrlYeFS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄【COOLING BLANKETS FOR HOT SLEEPERS】SOLEDI cooling blankets are made of the latest Japanese cooling touch technologyfabric. Q-Max>0.41, far exceeding other fibers, specially designed for restless nights. This fibers material does a great job of absorbing your body heat and feel cool while touching. With this cooling blanket for hot sleepers, keeping your body cool all night, you will fall asleep faster, sleep longer and get a deeper sleep. ❄【INNOVATIVE DOUBLE SIDED DESIGN】Cooling blankets for sleeping in reversible design with mica nylon & viscose on the front side is breathable for hot summer use, which keeps you cool and dry by absorbing and dispersing unnecessary body heat. A-Side is made of 50% nylon and 50% viscose, B-Side keeps warm. ❄【LIGHTWEIGHT & PORTABLE】Available in 2 sizes: 59\"x76\", 87\"x 79\". The quality soft fabrics make the blanket even lighter. Perfect for the couch, sofa, bed, car, train, airplane, office, travel, cinema, park, beach. In addition to the cooling touch properties of cooling fabrics, our dense weave cooling blanket is also breathable, moisture-wicking, and anti-static. Keeps you cool and comfortable on sweltering summer nights. ❄【PERFECT GIFT FOR SOMEONE YOU CARE ABOUT】The latest Japanese cooling technology enhances cool touch and deep sleep. A cooling blanket absorbs heat to keep adults, children, babies cool on warm nights, perfect for hot sleepers night sweats. Perfect for travel, camping or on the go to enjoy the cool summer anytime, the perfect summer gift for a loved one. ❄【EASY TO CARE】The cooling fiber material is special but easy to maintain and can be easily washed by hand or machine. Please follow the instructions for washing and maintenance: Mild Washing < 30℃, Do not bleach, Do not iron, Do not dry clean, and hang in the shade. We offer 40 days of free return and replacement service. If you have any questions when receiving the product, please do not hesitate to contact us, we will solve the problem for you immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eJKrlYeFS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOLEDI","source_asin":"B0B17SHXGD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1028460","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B17SHXGD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B17SHXGD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
