window.products.push({"id":1028607,"name":"CoTa Global Sea Turtle Refrigerator Blue Sand Magnets Set of 4 - Assorted Resin Beach Design, Fun & Cute Animal Rhinestone Magnet For Kitchen Fridge, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813JXwb-vYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE OCEAN SEA TURTLE BLUE SAND MAGNET DECOR COMES WITH UNIQUE DESIGN YOU WILL LOVE – Add an extra touch of beach vibes to your day & display your collection of cute ocean life novelty magnets! Perfect resin magnet decor can attach to any metallic surface & will make it look breezy & cool. Turtle Blue Sand Magnets are decorated with beach theme vibrant colorful decoration. A must-have home & office accessory for hanging beach vacation memories. THE COOL FRIDGE MAGNETS ARE FOR WHIMSICAL NOVELTIES LOVERS – Perfect home & office ornament for magnet collectors & sea life animal lovers who'd like to add funky decor magnets to their stationery to help them stay organized. Surprise your colleagues with entertaining unique decorative blue sand magnets to hang pictures, memories, pictures & random notes. Ideal for parents who love leaving cute notes for their little ones or post grocery lists. INCLUDED WITH THE PURCHASE OF CUTE REFRIGERATOR MAGNETS SET - Includes CoTa Global Assorted design Set of 4 Sea Turtle Blue Sand Fridge Magnets. The magnets feature sea turtles adorned with beach-inspired palm trees and shells. Blue sand magnetic set feature rhinestones & realistic details, colored with vibrant colors making them the perfect accent for plain-colored refrigerators. Cute kitchen fridge magnets measure 3.25″L x 4″W x 0.3″H. HIGH-QUALITY SEA LIFE ANIMAL BLUE SAND MAGNETS – Fun magnets for refrigerator are made of premium quality resin construction molded in unique shapes and have a strong magnet attached to the back of each 3D-shaped colorful sea turtle figure. The turtle figures are shaped in a unique way, resulting in the perfect decoration item for your office, locker, and refrigerator door. Make the magnets stand out and display the beautifully designed turtles. IDEAL USE FOR THE SEA CREATURE REFRIGERATOR MAGNETS SET - Decorate your kitchen fridge door, dishwasher, locker, whiteboards, cabinet, & any metal surfaces that attract magnets with fun novelty magnets. Sea turtle magnets make a cool display on the kitchen fridge & amusing locker decor to help in posting notes, recipes, checklists, reminders, photos, & drawings. Perfect set of functional multi-use magnets for the home or any office work-space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813JXwb-vYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Puzzled","source_asin":"B01M683C69","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1028607","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M683C69","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M683C69","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
