window.products.push({"id":1028616,"name":"KMAT Kitchen Rugs and Mats [2 PCS] Super Absorbent Microfiber Kitchen Mat Non Slip Machine Washable Runner Carpets for Floor, Kitchen, Bathroom, Sink,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91gN5Z0kxUS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMFORT & SUPER ABSORPTION: The KMAT kitchen rugs are constructed with water absorbent microfiber,which will quickly dry after absorbing a large amount of water or oil and maintain its good standing as new. The microfiber mats with high piles are soft to the touch and its shaggy surface offers comfort underfoot to keep your bare feet warm and protects your kitchen floor from water damage. PERFECT SIZE & VERSATILITY: The set contains 2 rectangular rugs(17.3 x 28 inches and 17.3 x 47 inches).The KMAT kitchen mat provides an extra large activity area in bathroom,laundry room,kitchen,bedroom,office and by the sink.The unique design and neutral color matches any décor.And pets love to sleep and play on these warm, soft mats! It's a perfect gift for friends and family! MACHINE WASHABLE: The pemium microfiber and eco-friendly TPR material we selected to use in the kitchen rugs and mats are machine washable and can remove stains easily. Simply toss it into the washing machine with gentle detergent on the gentle cycle and let it air dry.Our rugs are seriously tested to ensure that they can withstand frequent machine washings and still maintain shape. NON-SLIP BACKING AND DURABILITY: The bottom of the washable rug is made of non skid TPR material that can prevent slippage to the greatest extent and ensure safety, fading and abrasion resistance.【NOTE】Only place the mat on a DRY FLAT SURFACE and always keep the bottom of the carpet dry. Water under the carpet may result in slippage. IDEAL CHOICE:The premium material and considerate design of microfiber kitchen runner rugs make it high harmonious matching to your various decoration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91gN5Z0kxUS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KMAT","source_asin":"B0B5QX5JBT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1028616","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5QX5JBT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5QX5JBT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
