window.products.push({"id":1028634,"name":"3 Pack Wine Bottle Stopper, RICANK Reusable Plastic & Silicone Set of 3 Wine Stopper Efficient Sealed Storage Sealed Wine Preserver Keep Wine Sparklin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612qAoJRAvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep Wine Fresh and Sealed : The mini wine sealer provides an air-tight seal, locks the gas in the bottle, to preserve the opened wine bottle. It preserves better than the original cork and prolongs the wine freshness. The wine bottle stopper can preserve your wine’s fresh flavor for several days. Light and Elegant Design: The rounded design fits the sparkling wine bottle is not only lightweight and weighs about 1.06 ounce, but also has 3 steel balls inside, which can clamp the bottleneck. It is small in size and easy to store. By optimizing the internal structure, the wine bottle stoppers fit perfectly to form a closed state, which minimize the oxidation of the wine. After installation, even if it is tilted or lay in the level , it will not leak. Convenient to Use: The red wine saver corkscrew adopts a rotating design. Just insert the stopper onto the bottle and rotate the stopper to \" LOCK \", rotate to \" UNLOCK \" to open it. It is convenient and fast to rotate the top counterclockwise to loosen, and clockwise to tighten. Only need to rotate the upper part of the cork to unlock, and then plug it into the bottle mouth tightly, and then turn the upper part of the wine bottle sealer back to lock the original flavor. Safe and High Quality: Made from high quality and durable Food-Grade Silicone inside and food-grade ABS outside. The internal seal of the wine bottle stopper is made of food contact grade silicone material, which is safer. The round wine stopper shell is made of wear-resistant ABS material, which is easy to clean. Widely Applicable: Great for a household, hotel, club, bar and more to use. Suit for events, holidays and party, and makes a great gift . The 3 pack wine sealer fits standard wine, beer and soda bottles (note: suitable only for wine bottles with an inner diameter of 18-19mm).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612qAoJRAvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RICANK","source_asin":"B09S5TYX52","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1028634","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09S5TYX52","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09S5TYX52","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
