window.products.push({"id":1028663,"name":"Fissler Blue Point Schnellkochtopf Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ThCYFp1CL._AC_.jpg","description":"Fissler Blue Point pressure cookers combine healthy nutrition with gentle cooking, since atmospheric oxygen is expelled and the cooking periods are quite short. Vitamins and minerals, as well as nutrients and flavor, are thus preserved. You can see and taste the difference. With Blue Point, you save up to 70% of the regular cooking time and as much as 50% of the energy traditionally used in cooking. Blue Point pressure cookers have two pressure levels, a gentle pressure level for cooking delicate food like vegetables and fish without destroying nutrients, and a speed pressure level for cooking meats and stews quickly. Blue Point pressure cookers are very unique in that they are completely silent. There is no unnerving rattling or hissing while pressure is inside. Once the oxygen is expelled and the valve locks into place, hardly any steam escapes into the air during the cooking process keeping the kitchen cooler. Because there is no steam, there are no cooking odors. Blue Point pressure cookers exceed the minimum safety requirements of Europe and the United States with patented innovative features such as the Euromatic safety valve, residual pressure block, interlocking lid, and automatic steam release. The CookStar all-stove base, comprised of a pure aluminum core and high-quality 18/10 stainless steel, ensures that the base that will never separate or warp. The energy-saving base also provides quick optimal heat distribution, diffusion, and storage without any hot spots. Safe for use on induction stoves and in the dishwasher. Limited lifetime warranty. Made in Germany.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ThCYFp1CL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fissler","source_asin":"B001FBFHVA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1028663","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001FBFHVA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001FBFHVA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1028664,"name":"Hisense Air Purifier with True HEPA Technology, Air Purifier for Home Allergies Pets Dander Smokers in Bedroom, 25db Quiet Air Cleaner Remove Smoke Du","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51j3bnrRX6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Breathe Easier The Hisense tabletop air purifier removes impurities to help keep your home conveniently fresh, and clean​. The reliable and eco-friendly air purifier can cover an area of up to 376 ft²/ 35 m², making it perfect for large rooms and offices. Easy control and the very low sound level make this a versatile choice. Key Features The Hisense KJ120 CADR 120 m3/h 3-Speed desktop air purifier quickly removes 99.97% of dust, pollen, smoke, odors, mold spores, and pet dander in the air. Additional features include an aroma diffuser, easily accessible filter, and air quality indicator. Air Quality Indicator Light The LED indicator displays the indoor air quality on a scale of good to poor (Blue - Amber - Red). When the unit senses a change in air quality, it automatically adjusts the fan speed to optimally clean the environment. Sleep Mode The noise level is nearly silent at sleep mode with only 25db. The night light can be turned off to enjoy a perfect night of sleep without the effect of light. Aroma Diffuse Add a drop of essential oil (not included) and some water into the sponge below the purifier air outlet, then the fragrance will flow with air movements. 3 Speed and Turbo Setting 3 Fan Speeds & SIMPLE TO USE: 3 adjustable fan speeds that meet your needs whether for faster purification or quiet operation. Using this air purifier couldn’t be easier, as one-button operation turns it on/off and controls the fan speed. More Efficient Powerful intake design maximizes efficiency and purifies air faster, keeping your space conveniently fresh. Now, here's the technical bit… Below, you’ll find all the technical details, such as dimension etc. Air Purifier General Features Read voltage/frequency 100-240V / 50Hz - 60hz Unit Control Type Electronic Display LED Light Fan Control Touch Button Turbo Mode Yes Fan Speed 3 Timer Yes, up to 8 hours Fan Speeds 3 Speeds (HIGH, MEDIUM, LOW) Air Purifier Performance Model # KJ120 CADR 120 m3/h Coverage Up to 376.74 sq ft Noise Level in dB(A) ≤45 dB(A) Air Purifier Filter Pre-filtration Layer Yes HEPA Yes Active Carbon Yes Cold Catalyst N/A RCI (UV) N/A Ionizer N/A Air Purifier Approvals Safety ETL CARB Energy N/A Dimensions Product dimensions 8.3 x 8.3 x 12.4 Net weight 3.8 / 5 UPC 819130027807 Accessories User Manual Yes Adapter Yes Warranty Parts & Labor 1 year Toggle keyboard_arrow_down","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51j3bnrRX6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hisense","source_asin":"B088D7KF9Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1028664","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088D7KF9Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088D7KF9Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
