window.products.push({"id":1028771,"name":"Scratch Off Map of the United States Poster, includes ALL 63 US National Parks, 42 USA Landmarks & 15 Adventures, 5.5”x8.25” Travel Journal, Gifts for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814bPoD8RGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A beautiful creative showpiece, easy to scratch and a great way to track your travels! Great for tracking your bucket list, too! Easy to frame and display, perfect for anyone looking to track and savor their adventures. With the class and glamour of a frame-worthy print, no other cross country travel scratch off poster kit offers so much value. This stylish scratch map of America would make ideal teacher appreciation gifts, and a perfect Christmas present for high school and college student gifts, mom, dad, teens and kids. Vibrant custom illustrations of each US state include 42 famous landmarks, major national parks, 15 travel adventures, with an adventure sticker set and bonus travel journal. The enjoyable art you’ll discover when scratching off the map’s gold foil is so much fun. Simply scratch away each new place or landmark you visit as a fond reminder of trips taken! 250gsm laminated full color map with gold foil scratch top layer and full color under-layer. Sturdy packaging tube ensures your scratch map arrives in perfect condition! Matching journal with 300gsm matte laminated art cover and stitch sewn binding. 30 lined sheets, 60 pages with interior back pocket for storing keepsakes. USA Scratch Map Dimensions: 17 inches tall x 24 inches wide Travel Journal Dimensions: 8.25 inches tall x 5.5 inches wide What’s Included: 1 x Laminated scratch off map of the United States map poster1 x Gift-ready package tube to protect the scratch map USA1 x Storage pouch to keep tools together1 x Scratch off pen to precisely scratch your travels15 x Adhesive adventure stickers for sticking to map8 x Location flags to mark the states visited8 x Holding pins to easily pin map to wall1 x Microfiber cloth to keep your map clean1 x Eraser to carefully remove any smudges you’re your US scratch off map Travelers, your travel adventure awaits!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814bPoD8RGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bright Standards","source_asin":"B08WYF8XLS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1028771","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WYF8XLS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WYF8XLS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
