window.products.push({"id":1028798,"name":"IOIOW Air Purifier for Bedroom, H13 True HEPA Filter Air Cleaner, 3-Stage Filtration with 360° Air Intake, Home Room Air Purifier with 3 Speed, Sleep ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613SibyH7gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get away from polluted air surrounding, keep distance from pet's hair and peculiar smell, no worry about respiratory problem any more, all the problem solved by choosing a true hepa air purifier we suggested. Breathe differently, enjoy a clean and clear lifestyle from now on! 3-IN-1 FILTRATION SYSTEM - Equipped with 3-stage filtration system: re-filter, H13 HEPA filter, activated carbon filter. Built-in smart filter will remind you filter replacement by turning red, each filter element can be used for 3-6 months. If you need to replace filter, please search for \"B09ZKY98TV\" on Amazon to purchase. WIDE COVERAGE - Our small room air purifier will change the air quality in an area of 177 sq ft within 20 mins. 530 sq ft room air can be purified in just one hour. Ideal choice for bedrooms, children's rooms, offices. It is quite essential to choose an air cleaner to reduce the probability of diseases for your family health. THREE SPEEDS & SILENT SLEEP - The portable desktop air purifier operates as 24dB in sleep mode, which allows you to enjoy a quiet and deep sleep! 3 speed settings (sleep, low speed, high speed) to meet different air quality and personal needs. Turn on the automatic 4-hour timer instead of manual operated when you fall asleep. Saving energy and reduce emission. 360° AIR INTAKE & AROMATHERAPY - The 360° aerodynamic air inlet absorbs air impurities in all directions to speeds up purification. It works stably in performance no matter you place it anywhere. You will enjoy fragrance pervading the room within a minute by adding a few drops of essential oil at an aromatherapy pad on top of the tabletop air cleaner.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613SibyH7gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IOIOW","source_asin":"B09PMPR6KT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1028798","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PMPR6KT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PMPR6KT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
