window.products.push({"id":1028989,"name":"Villeroy & Boch New Wave Sugar & Creamer Set, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VZTppRaML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM CRAFTSMANSHIP. Villeroy & Boch is an innovative company with outstanding design expertise and a long history dating back over 270 years. From the tiles on board the Titanic and in the Holland Tunnel in New York to tableware series produced specially for the Vatican and royal families – during this period, the brand Villeroy & Boch has left lasting impressions all over the world. SIMPLY EXCEPTIONAL. Discover the success story behind the luxurious design language of the NewWave collection. The incomparable series proves to be an eye-catcher for any set table. Made from the finest premium porcelain, the entire collection is suitable for everyday use and is both dishwasher and microwave safe. AWARD-WINNING COLLECTION. The NewWave collection boasts an asymmetrical shape and curving lines. Awarded the “Trend Dish of the Year”, the decor has been a bestseller from the very start and is a stunning centerpiece on any table. Create fabulous dessert tables, über-hip tea parties, and luxurious \"me time\" while indulging in your favorite coffee and tea service. This 2-piece set includes an 8.5oz covered sugar jar and a 6.5oz creamer. TIMELESS GIFT. The variety and design of the products include everything consumers need to make their homes more beautiful: from high-quality home accessories to crockery, cutlery, and glasses. Anyone looking for inspiring gifts is sure to find the perfect items at Villeroy & Boch. SPECIAL MOMENTS IN LIFE. Reflecting this philosophy, Villeroy & Boch adds a decorative touch to its customers’ living environments, combining passion with design expertise and innovative strength. Since its foundation in 1748, the company has developed to become one of the world's leading lifestyle brands and creates feel-good moments and living spaces with the best ceramics from its Bathroom & Wellness and Dining & Lifestyle Divisions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VZTppRaML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Villeroy & Boch","source_asin":"B019RQXFV8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1028989","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019RQXFV8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019RQXFV8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
